@WorkflowEngine.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5148

### List workflow definitions
GET {{WorkflowEngine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workflows/definitions

### Run greeting workflow
POST {{WorkflowEngine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workflows/run/greeting?name=VietDA

### Run order approval - auto approve (under $1000)
POST {{WorkflowEngine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workflows/run/order-approval
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-001",
  "amount": 500,
  "requestedBy": "john.doe"
}

### Run order approval - requires review (>= $1000)
POST {{WorkflowEngine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workflows/run/order-approval
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-002",
  "amount": 5000,
  "requestedBy": "jane.smith"
}
